<title>USA: St. Jude gets CE mark for Trilogy DC+.</title>
<headline>St. Jude gets CE mark for Trilogy DC+.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>St. Jude Medical Inc said Tuesday it received Conformite Europeenne Mark approval of its Trilogy DC+ pacemaker.</p>
<p>The DC+ is the latest in a line of pacemakers designed by St. Jude's Pacesetter unit.</p>
<p>Trilogy pacemakers can automatically adapt their settings based on data collected and analyzed about the patient's heart and the heart's interaction with the pacing system, St. Jude said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
